  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="work" n="8">
        <pb n="144"/>
        <head>The Suffrages of <persName>Mar Balai</persName></head>
        <head>Of Priests.</head>
        <lg n="8.1">
          <l n="1">Into the Paradise of <placeName>Eden</placeName>,</l>
          <l n="2">And into the place of delights—</l>
          <l n="3">Thither are arriving</l>
          <l n="4">The worshippers of the Cross.</l>
          <l n="5">And they sing without ceasing</l>
          <l n="6">Praises perpetually.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg n="8.2">
          <l n="7">May our brothers and fathers,</l>
          <l n="8">And our teachers, all of them,</l>
          <l n="9">Be among the Saints</l>
          <l n="10">In shady bowers,</l>
          <l n="11">Rejoicing and exulting</l>
          <l n="12">And leaping for joy in the Bridechamber.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg n="8.3">
          <l n="13">The priests, Lord, who have ministered to Thee,</l>
          <l n="14">And the deacons who have hovered over Thee,</l>
          <l n="15">Who have kept watch in the midst of Thy Church,—</l>
          <l n="16">May they be with <persName>Aaron</persName>.</l>
        </lg>
        <lg n="8.4">
          <l n="17">Glory to Him that liveth,</l>
          <l n="18">Who came down and tasted death,</l>
          <l n="19">And comforted the mourners</l>
          <l n="20">For (the loss of) their beloved ones.</l>
          <l n="21">Blessed is He that by His death</l>
          <l n="22">Delivered us from death.</l>
        </lg>
      </div>
    </body>
